{'symbol': 'BA', 'date': '2022-09-27 08:00:00', 'title': 'BOEING DELIVERS ON 100TH 737-800 BCF ORDER TO AERCAP', 'text': "SEATTLE , SEPT. 27, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- BOEING (NYSE: BA) AND AERCAP (NYSE: AER) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE MILESTONE DELIVERY OF THE 100TH CONTRACTED 737-800 BOEING CONVERTED FREIGHTER (BCF) TO THE WORLD'S LARGEST LESSOR, AERCAP."}